# data/ is the working cache (see docs/07_ARTIFACT_STORAGE.md). The 155
# tracked files under it are deliberate: small JSON/CSV manifests and proof
# images that validation cases reference by relative path. New bulk media or
# generated artifacts must NOT be committed here — they belong in the local
# artifact root with hashes recorded in versioned manifests.
